        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;*1 The shared file layer sits outside a run&lt;br&gt;An AWS HealthOmics run gets its shared file system (run storage) from the service. FSx for ONTAP is a candidate where you supply the shared layer (AWS Batch on EC2, your own HPC, on premises).&lt;br&gt;*2 The two frames are deliberately not joined&lt;br&gt;Whether a HealthOmics run can take an FSx for ONTAP S3 Access Point as input is unverified.&lt;br&gt;*3 FlexCache with a non-AWS ONTAP service as Origin is unverified" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=none;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
